  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup></math> are in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AP</mi></math>. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>84</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>243</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>81</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Thus, the first three terms of the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AP</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>27</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence, its fifth term <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>53</mn></math></p>",
